/-!
# The final assembly: the certificates

Generated by a script.

The regimes' constants of `RMF/UniformLower/FinalNumerals.lean`, bounded below on cells of `q` in
log space with every factor at its worse end, `π ≤ 3.1416`, `(1 - e^{-100})·0.31689 ≥ 0.3165`
and `c₃ ≥ c`: `RMF.cellLogCore` (the core `cRed(q)2^{2q-1}(Gq/64)^qΓ(q)` for `q ≤ ½`),
`RMF.cellLogMain` (B1), `RMF.cellLogErr` (the error constant), `RMF.cellLogHalfCore`
(`(G/128)^q` for `q ≥ ½`).  Certificates by `interval_decide (trust := kernel)`:

* B1, `0 < q ≤ 9/20`: 19 cells, ends in units of `1/400`, `c₃ = c3OneTab` at the cell's left end
  (`RMF.finalB1_spec`);
* B2 `[9/20, ½)`, H `q = ½`, S `(½, ½ + 1/(2·10⁸)]`: one cell each; F and L: one inequality each;
* the mid range `2100 ≤ log log x ≤ 6000` below `½`: B1″ on 25 cells inside B1's
  (`RMF.cellLogMainMid`, `RMF.cellLogErrMid`, `RMF.finalB1Mid_spec`), B2″ on one cell, and NH and
  F″ one inequality each.

The dispatchers `RMF.finalCells_spec` and `RMF.finalCellsMid_spec`.

The functions are in `RMF/UniformLower/FinalCells/Defs.lean` and the cells of B1 and B1″ in
`RMF/UniformLower/FinalCells/`, five to a file.
-/

namespace RMF

/-! ### B1: the dispatch -/

/-- **B1, `0 < q ≤ 9/20`**: the cell of `q`, with its data and certificates. -/
theorem finalB1_spec {q : ℝ} (hq0 : 0 < q) (hq : q ≤ 9 / 20) :
    ∃ a b c β ℓ u lam : ℝ, a ≤ q ∧ q ≤ b ∧ b ≤ 9 / 20 ∧ 0 < c ∧ c ≤ 1 ∧ c ≤ c3FloorK q 1
      ∧ q * (1 - 2 * q) ≤ β ∧ ℓ ≤ q * Real.log q ∧ u ≤ max (37 / 2) (6000 * a)
      ∧ lam ≤ cellLogMain a b c β ℓ
      ∧ 1 / 10 ^ 10 + 216 * Real.exp (-32) + Real.exp (cellLogErr b u) ≤ Real.exp lam := by
  rcases le_or_gt q (2 / 400) with h0 | h0
  · exact finalB1Cell_0 hq0 h0
  rcases le_or_gt q (13 / 400) with h1 | h1
  · exact finalB1Cell_1 h0.le h1
  rcases le_or_gt q (21 / 400) with h2 | h2
  · exact finalB1Cell_2 h1.le h2
  rcases le_or_gt q (28 / 400) with h3 | h3
  · exact finalB1Cell_3 h2.le h3
  rcases le_or_gt q (34 / 400) with h4 | h4
  · exact finalB1Cell_4 h3.le h4
  rcases le_or_gt q (39 / 400) with h5 | h5
  · exact finalB1Cell_5 h4.le h5
  rcases le_or_gt q (44 / 400) with h6 | h6
  · exact finalB1Cell_6 h5.le h6
  rcases le_or_gt q (49 / 400) with h7 | h7
  · exact finalB1Cell_7 h6.le h7
  rcases le_or_gt q (53 / 400) with h8 | h8
  · exact finalB1Cell_8 h7.le h8
  rcases le_or_gt q (57 / 400) with h9 | h9
  · exact finalB1Cell_9 h8.le h9
  rcases le_or_gt q (62 / 400) with h10 | h10
  · exact finalB1Cell_10 h9.le h10
  rcases le_or_gt q (67 / 400) with h11 | h11
  · exact finalB1Cell_11 h10.le h11
  rcases le_or_gt q (73 / 400) with h12 | h12
  · exact finalB1Cell_12 h11.le h12
  rcases le_or_gt q (80 / 400) with h13 | h13
